<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST333"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:webmaster@catchbtk.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Tom_voigt<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tom_voigt<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, June 24, 2004 - 4:40 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Here&#39;s a link: <BR><a href="http://www.kake.com/home/headlines/849312.html"> <b>BTK Back</b></a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 333-->
<!--Post: 334--><!--Time: 1088121952-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST334"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rachel<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rachel<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, June 24, 2004 - 5:05 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hi Tom~ <BR> <BR>Thanks for the great post. What always seemed odd to me was that BTK killed the entire family. Most serial killers either attack men, women, couples, the elderly or children - not an entire family. I have been wondering if maybe Mrs. Otero was the main target and BTK did not expect the two children to be home from school. Maybe he also thought Mr. Otero would be away from the home, too. Your thoughts?? <BR> <BR>Secondly, and I apologize for being graphic, but I wonder how much semen was left near each body. Did he masturbate four times therefore, ejeculating four times? Or just once and &#40;sorry&#41; sort of spread it around. It may sound stupid, but I wonder if he could have masturbated earlier and brought the semen with him? <BR> <BR>Again sorry for my subject matter. If you don&#39;t mind, I&#39;d like your opinion. Thank you! <BR> <BR>Rachel<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 334-->
<!--Post: 339--><!--Time: 1088177975-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST339"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Screamer<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Screamer<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, June 25, 2004 - 8:39 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Rachel, <BR> <BR>If my memory serves me right the two Otero children killed were home sick. Mr. Otero was dropping off the other kids at school. I think that he probably returned home because of the other kids being sick or something.?? <BR> <BR>I don&#39;t think that BTK expected anyone other than Mrs Otero to be home. JMO.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 339-->
<!--Post: 341--><!--Time: 1088181083-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST341"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rachel<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rachel<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, June 25, 2004 - 9:31 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Thank you for the reply, Screamer~ <BR>I am definitely leaning toward Mrs. Otero as the main target and that Mr. Otero and the two children were basically in the wrong place at the wrong time... <BR>Rachel<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 341-->
<!--Post: 351--><!--Time: 1088310270-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST351"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bookworm<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bookworm<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, June 26, 2004 - 9:24 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I&#39;m wondering if all the children were the father&#39;s natural children. Joseph II, a junior, is usually given to a first born son. Josephine also sounds like she was named after her father. <BR> <BR>Were the two children killed the youngest?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 351-->
<!--Post: 362--><!--Time: 1088488638-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST362"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Laoise<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Laoise<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, June 28, 2004 - 10:57 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Yes the 2 killed were the youngest. I dont remember where I heard it, on a news report I think, but they said that the 3 oldest werent full siblings to the 2 youngest.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 362-->
<!--Post: 363--><!--Time: 1088548544-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST363"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bookworm<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bookworm<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, June 29, 2004 - 3:35 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Thank you Laoise.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 363-->
<!--Post: 443--><!--Time: 1089701511-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST443"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->George<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->George<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, July 12, 2004 - 11:51 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Rachel, <BR>Regarding your original question -- and it&#39;s sometimes necessary to be graphic but not comfortable to write about or read it, I agree -- from the way the paper describes things I think BTK may have satisfied himself once or twice and flung &#40;or whatever&#41; the evidence &#34;at the scene&#34; of the male victims as a form of harsh derision, and perhaps  with the females he lingered a little longer, and enjoyed it a little more. <BR>That said, I also think he was quite capable of four separate satisfactions as well.  <BR> <BR>I really see Josephine being hanged in the basement as highly symbolic. Execution. Not just being hanged but also where she was hanged. The basement. The dungeon. <BR>Again, that said, it&#39;s also possible BTK did find the girl in the basement and didn&#39;t feel like carrying her up the stairs. --After all, there were no further hangings that I&#39;m aware of, but then the eleven year-old would have weighed much less than later, grown women would have weighed and was therefore easier to hang. Perhaps if Mike Kelleher, time permitting, has a thought? <BR> <BR>Tom, a long first post, yes. I checked the site, I&#39;m not repeating anything but I know you have to clear room from previous threads so delete this if someone else has touched on the topic weeks or months ago. <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 443-->
<!--Post: 444--><!--Time: 1089702469-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST444"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:webmaster@catchbtk.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Tom_voigt<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tom_voigt<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, July 13, 2004 - 12:07 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->George, no problems here.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 444-->
<!--Post: 453--><!--Time: 1089728380-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST453"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Micaela<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Micaela<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, July 13, 2004 - 7:19 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hello George, <BR> <BR>Just an FYI. When BTK killed Shirley Vian, locking her children in the bathroom, he was interrupted by a phone call, &#40;he stated&#41;. But he goes on in the letter to describe what he was wanting to do to the little girl. I do not have the exact quote, but it was something like, &#34;And then I was going to save the girl for last and watch her hang to death. God, oh God, what a sexual release that would have been.&#34; <BR> <BR>He was, is, one sick puppy. <BR> <BR>Jaden <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 453-->
<!--Post: 473--><!--Time: 1089800287-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST473"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->George<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->George<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, July 14, 2004 - 3:18 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Micaela, <BR>Thanks, that just about confirms it. Even if he was lying about being interrupted by a phone call <BR>&#40;the Kevin Bright interview describes a BTK who seemed to be one who would not have suddenly run off due to a simple phone-ringing&#41; BTK&#39;s explicit mention of a repeated hanging of a child, uh, cinches things.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 473-->
